% ==================== 1. INTRODUCTION ====================
\section{Introduction}
 
This report is prepared to document the damage found on the panel doors of Chiller 3 upon arrival at the SGW Google Data Center site. The chiller is a CDHH Trane unit intended for installation at the site.
 
During the initial inspection at the warehouse prior to loading, no damage was observed on the panel doors. However, upon arrival at the site, the right and left panel doors were found to be dented. The dent is considered severe, and the frame that holds the door is also bent. As a result, the door is difficult to open, which obstructs inspection and any maintenance work that requires the panel door to be opened.
 
This report presents the identified damage, the possible causes, the repairability assessment, the impact on chiller performance, and the recommended preventive measures. The report focuses specifically on the dented panel doors. Other minor findings reported by the Samsung inspection team are noted briefly.
 
