% ==================== 6. IMPACT ON CHILLER PERFORMANCE ====================
\section{Impact on Chiller Performance}
 
The dent is located only on the electrical panel door. It does not affect the airflow inside the chiller, and it does not impact the cooling performance of the chiller.
 
Based on the inspection, the dent is cosmetic and does not affect chiller cooling performance, but it does obstruct maintenance access. The only affected area is the panel door. The door can be closed, but it is difficult to open, which obstructs inspection and any maintenance work that requires the panel door to be opened.
 
