\section{Other Observations from Inspection}
 
The inspection team from Samsung reported that, apart from the dented panel doors, there are no other damages on the chiller. Minor rusted parts were also observed. These rusted parts can be treated by spraying and can be settled easily.
 
The Samsung inspection team confirmed that there are no other damages besides the dented panel doors and the minor rusted parts.
 
