% ==================== 8. RECOMMENDATIONS AND PREVENTIVE MEASURES ====================
\section{Recommendations and Preventive Measures}
 
\subsection{Immediate Actions for Chiller 3}
 
The dented panel doors should be repaired by panel beating or dent pulling, and the door frame and hinge alignment should be adjusted so that the door opens smoothly. The minor rusted parts identified by the Samsung inspection team should be treated by spraying.
 
\subsection{Improved Packing and Protection for Future Shipments}
 
Panel doors and other exposed surfaces should be protected with wrapping, foam, or wooden bracing before transportation. Chains should not be tightened directly against the chiller body without a protective layer in between.
 
\subsection{Inspection Protocol Enhancements}
 
Photographic records should be taken at every inspection stage, including the condition of the chiller at the warehouse before loading, during loading, and upon arrival at site. This will help identify the stage at which any damage occurs and support any future claims.
 
